{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11204140","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11204140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1120414001:0":{"text":"갈리, 너한테 대필을 맡긴 잭슨이라는 사람… 세일린워터 마을에서 평판이 그다지 좋지 않은 것 같아.","source_cn":"四处打听了一圈，感觉……伽利，请你代笔写信的那个贾克松...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x619B956D8407A7AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120414002:0":{"text":"네가 볼 때 그는 어떤 사람이었어?","source_cn":"他究竟是个怎样的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0798F647544DB508","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120414003:0":{"text":"음… 방금 전에 누가 아주 정확하게 묘사했어. 잭슨은 아주 무섭게 생겼지.","source_cn":"他？刚才有人形容得比较准确，贾克松面相很凶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAE07D34CB6D3CC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120414004:0":{"text":"하지만 겉모습으로 사람을 판단하면 안 돼! 모래 폭풍을 피한 후 목마른 나에게 그는 얼마 남지 않은 물을 나눠줬는걸!","source_cn":"但外表只是假象，我们不能光从骨骼和皮肤上判断一个人！最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE405E8F5999890E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120414005:0":{"text":"학회의 수첩에는 크림슨 고원에서는 물 한 모금에 생사가 갈린다고 적혀 있었어. 그래서 난 그에게 또 다른 희망을 주기 위해 편지를 대필해 준 거고.","source_cn":"在深红高原，多一口水，就多一分活下去的可能性，学会自然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA676EB7AA3641EE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120414006:0":{"text":"그러니까, 이 편지를 잭슨의 어머니에게 전달할 수만 있다면, 오늘 하루 동안 현장 조사는 중단할 수도 있어!","source_cn":"这封信一定得交到贾克松母亲手里，为此，我愿意暂停一天的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8540E330C2C254F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120414007:0":{"text":"이봐! 그쪽! 방금 잭슨 얘기하는 것 같던데, 잭슨이 돌아온 거야?","source_cn":"嘿！你们！刚才有人在说贾克松，是不是？他回来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99F3ED73A559BF11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120414008:0":{"text":"응? 누구지…?","source_cn":"嗯，是谁在插话……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A6F511888219E43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:梅丽莎":{"text":"멜리사","source":"梅丽莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伽利":{"text":"갈리","source":"伽利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:突兀的声音":{"text":"갑작스러운 소리","source":"突兀的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}